From 48155c231eb9a05fe25ca3ef60778392eb257a72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Carlos Alberto <psncarlosalberto4ti@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 20:10:43 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(standby): implement unified multi-service stop, RTSP
 teardown and host transmitter termination

- Add stop_gnome_network_displays in miracast_launcher.rs to kill gnome-network-displays and video streamer sessions via SIGTERM/SIGKILL
- Update ControlAction::StopStreaming in sender/src/main.rs to kill host transmitters, external GStreamer instances, child encoder processes, and close USB pipes
- Add terminate_active_sessions in receiver/src/wfd.rs to cleanly shut down active RTSP and MS-MICE TCP client sockets
- Update /api/stream/stop and /api/host/control in receiver/src/web.rs to stop all 3 modes, trigger RTSP teardown, clear frame cache, and display persistent ready splash
- Maintain physical HDMI connection without blanking or connector unbind
- Fix button toggle states and telemetry sync in web_ui.rs for standby mode
- Add Blueprint 25 (PT/EN) and Obsidian Note 20
